00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:56.080
It's a really,
really well done series.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.855
And I was a history
major believe it or not.

00:14:58.855 --> 00:15:02.034
And with that history degree
I studied European history.

00:15:02.034 --> 00:15:05.169
I still had questions
